@startuml
!include _style.iuml
|API request|
start
:Upload IFC file (ifc.upload permission);
:Validate size, extension, schema header;
:Store in private storage;\nCreate model version (UPLOADED);
:Enqueue job "ifc.process_version"\nin the same transaction;
|Worker process|
:Claim job (SKIP LOCKED,\nfleet-wide concurrency ceiling);
:Parse in isolated subprocess\n(ifcopenshell, timeout, memory cap);
if (Parse succeeded?) then (no)
  :Version = FAILED\n(friendly error recorded);
  stop
else (yes)
endif
:Build spatial hierarchy;
:Extract elements, properties,\nquantities;
:Run model-quality checks;
:Version = READY or\nREADY_WITH_WARNINGS;
|User / worker|
:Generate geometry (optional job);
:Detect structural/service\ninterference (AABB overlap);
:Compare with previous revision\n(change records);
:Create coordination findings and\nimpact suggestions for review;
:Notify responsible members;
stop
@enduml
